{"summary": "Comment le grade, le rang et le niveau de forge modifient les stats et la valeur d'un objet, et ce que coûte chaque action de forge.", "headings": {"item-power": "Puissance de l'objet", "item-value": "Valeur de l'objet", "forge-costs": "Coûts de forge"}, "blocks": {"item-power": {"0": "<p>Les stats affichées sur une page d'objet sont ses <strong>valeurs de base</strong> (rang E, Commun, +0). La valeur réelle est la base multipliée par la puissance de l'objet :</p>", "2": "<p><code>rank</code> est le palier de l'objet (E = 1, D = 2, C = 3, B = 4, A = 5, S = 6, S+ = 7, Nation = 8) et <code>forge</code> son niveau de forge.</p>", "3": "<table><thead><tr><th>Grade</th><th>Multiplicateur de stat</th><th>Multiplicateur de valeur</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>F Trash</td><td>0.75</td><td>0.5</td></tr><tr><td>E Common</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>D Uncommon</td><td>1.15</td><td>1.6</td></tr><tr><td>C Rare</td><td>1.35</td><td>2.6</td></tr><tr><td>B Epic</td><td>1.6</td><td>4.5</td></tr><tr><td>A Legendary</td><td>2</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>S Mythic</td><td>2.6</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>EX Limited</td><td>2.4</td><td>12</td></tr></tbody></table>", "4": "<ul> <li>Bonus d’attaque, de PV et de stats : base × puissance (arrondi).</li> <li>Réduction de dégâts : base × rareté × (1 + 0.15 × (rang − 1)) × (1 + 0.03 × forge).</li> <li>Chance critique : base × rareté × (1 + 0.03 × forge).</li> <li>Stats bonus (affixes) : de 1 à 3 fois le rang chacune.</li> </ul>"}, "forge-costs": {"0": "<p>Passer au niveau <span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation>n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span>n</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span>1</span></span></span></span> coûte :</p>", "1": "<p><span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>1.35</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation>\\mathrm{cost} = \\left\\lfloor 10 \\times \\mathrm{rank} \\times (n+1)^{1.35} \\times \\mathrm{rarity\\ value} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span><span>cost</span></span><span></span><span>=</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span><span>⌊</span></span><span>10</span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span><span>rank</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span>(</span><span>n</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span><span>1</span><span><span>)</span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span><span><span><span>1.35</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span><span>rarity</span><span> </span><span>value</span></span><span><span>⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span> éclats</p>", "2": "<p>Une amélioration <strong>n’échoue jamais</strong>. Le maximum est +10 (+25 pour les armes de grade S, +30 pour EX et SP).</p>", "3": "<table><thead><tr><th>Amélioration d'un objet de rang E, Commun</th><th>Cost (éclats)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>+0 to +1</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>+4 to +5</td><td>87</td></tr><tr><td>+9 to +10</td><td>223</td></tr></tbody></table>", "4": "<ul> <li><strong>Montée de grade</strong> (nécessite +10) : <span><span><math><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>100</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2.2</mn><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>1.6</mn><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation>\\mathrm{round}_{100}\\!\\left(300 \\times 2.2^{\\mathrm{grade}} \\times 1.6^{\\mathrm{climbed}} \\times \\mathrm{rank}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span><span><span>round</span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span></span></span><span>​</span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span><span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span><span>300</span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span>2.</span><span><span>2</span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span><span><span><span><span>grade</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span>1.</span><span><span>6</span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span><span><span><span><span>climbed</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span><span>rank</span></span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span></span> éclats ; le niveau de forge revient à +0.</li> <li><strong>Reforge</strong> : <span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>⌋</mo></mrow><annotation>\\lfloor 2.5 \\times \\mathrm{value\\ at\\ +0} \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span>⌊</span><span>2.5</span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>value</span><span> </span><span>at</span><span> </span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span><span>0</span></span><span>⌋</span></span></span></span> éclats. Probabilités des nouveaux bonus : <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds#forge\">table de reforge</a>.</li> </ul>"}}}